# - If a section has an input element, it fills with that element's value
# - If a row section has input elements, it fills ALL sections IN THAT ROW with row-fill value (except ones already filled)
# - If a col section has input elements, it fills ALL sections IN THAT COL with col-fill value (except ones already filled)
# - At intersections of row-fill and col-fill: if values differ, use 6; if same, use that value

